<title>GREECE: Avg bids at Greek auction of 3-yr bonds at 99.22.</title>
<headline>Avg bids at Greek auction of 3-yr bonds at 99.22.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following information on the auction of three-, five-and seven-year fixed coupon bonds was made available by Bank of Greece.</p>
<p>   Bonds			     3-yr	  5-yr	 7-yr</p>
<p>   Coupon			    9.8%	  9.2%	 8.9%</p>
<p>   Face value (drs)	    1.0 million	1.0 million    1.0 million</p>
<p>   Min price accepted	   989,620     977,600    982,600</p>
<p>   Aver price accepted	  992,251.18  983,627.14 987,898.94</p>
<p>   Max offered price	   1,004,030   1,008,900  1,009,980</p>
<p>   Amount competitive(drs)     150 bln     100 bln     50 bln</p>
<p>   Amount non-competitive(drs)  45 bln	30 bln     15 bln</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
